Terminal isn't returning Python output in this session, so I'll analyze the raw JSON data I already fetched directly instead of relying on the shell.

Based on the `s0-hits.json` content I read (chunkCount 1447, hitCount 24733), scanning the `id` fields across `hitsByChunk[].hits[]`, I can see a clear pattern: many entries carry the leading French article/preposition baked into the `id`, not just the `surface`. Examples directly visible in the data:

```0:0:s0-hits.json
{"surface":"la pensée classique","id":"la pensée classique", ...}
{"surface":"les marxistes","id":"les marxistes", ...}
{"surface":"une multitude","id":"une multitude", ...}
{"surface":"des banques","id":"des banques", ...}
{"surface":"de l'acceptation","id":"de l'acceptation", ...}
{"surface":", d'affects","id":", d'affects", ...}
{"surface":"ainsi des machines","id":"ainsi des machines", ...}
{"surface":"cette nouvelle —","id":"cette nouvelle —", ...}
{"surface":"mais divers tradices","id":"mais divers tradices", ...}
{"surface":"la","id":"la","start":873,"end":875}
```

That last one — `{"surface":"la","id":"la"}` — is a pure function word (definite article) with no noun at all. Others like `"la"` (from "La fdairt逸"), `", ende"`, `", para"`, `"- une transistance"` also show punctuation and function words leaking into the `id`/`surface` pair.

So yes: **s0 命中数据中存在虚词**，具体表现为两类问题：
1. 纯虚词条目（如单独的 `"la"`），没有任何实义名词。
2. 名词短语的 `id` 里保留了冠词/介词/连词前缀（如 `"la pensée classique"`, `"des banques"`, `"une multitude"`, `"de l'acceptation"`），这些 `id` 本应该是去虚词后的名词形式，但实际上把虚词也编码进了 id 字符串里。这会导致同一个名词（如 "banques"）同时以带虚词和不带虚词两种 id 形式出现在数据里，造成重复/不一致。

我还没能读取 `s1-nouns-with-offsets.json` 的完整 `nouns` 数组来做同样的核查（前面只读到了 meta 和第一条 "pouvoir" 记录）。让我读取更多内容确认 s1 的情况。
